                <img src="/posts/meshtastic-client-update-1/P_20250829_200306.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">
            </div><p>My goal with this project is to build a fully open-source <a href="https://meshtastic.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Meshtastic</a>/<a href="https://meshcore.co.uk/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Meshcore</a> compatible client that is more &ldquo;rugged&rdquo; than what is currently available on the market. If there is enough interest, I will consider manufacturing a few and getting CE etc. certification done. If you are interested, please join the mailing list below.</p>]]></description></item><item><title>Upgrading my 25gbit internet router to VyOS</title><link>https://sschueller.github.io/posts/vyos-router-update/</link><pubDate>Fri, 16 May 2025 16:37:16 +0200</pubDate><author><name>Stefan Schüller</name></author><guid>https://sschueller.github.io/posts/vyos-router-update/</guid><description><![CDATA[<div class="featured-image">
                <img src="/posts/vyos-router-update/P_20250516_210518_1.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">
